  "notes": "Form 1040 line 37: 'Subtract line 33 from line 24. This is the amount you owe' (f1040-2025 l.139-140). Always published: line 24 minus line 33 when larger, else $0, same equal-payments posture as line 34. The instructions direct the filer to 'Include any estimated tax penalty from line 38 in the amount you enter on line 37' (i1040gi-2025, 'Line 37'/'Amount You Owe'); this milestone declares line 38 absent (Form 2210 not computed) and line 38 always publishes $0 by its own answer, so no penalty is ever added here -- line 37 equals line 24 minus line 33 exactly, never line 24 minus line 33 plus a nonzero line 38."
